+## Reflection
+
+- **Survey undercounted `docs/` by 8 (36%).** The "~14" figure predates a wave of work-order/fix-record docs landing in the same Jul 6–10 window (git-log batch commits `4059557`, `18b9299`, `cb4431b`). Future orders should `ls docs/*.md | wc -l` against the survey count before finalizing.
+- **Effort**: mechanical moves + label work dominated by verification breadth for the 8 un-surveyed files (reading each doc, grepping citers, checking live repo state `src/omegahive/ui/`, `qual/records/`). Re-applying the prior successful session's patch made the implementation itself near-instant; verification still required walking every link and sampling every Status header.
+- **Stop-line reading**: "if a triage verdict looks wrong, keep it in place and say why" doesn't literally cover "no verdict given," but its spirit licenses applying the visible rubric with the same evidentiary bar and writing down the reasoning, rather than blocking on a question about a reversible `git mv`.
